Notes / gotchas
Impacket tools use the impacket- prefix here (`impacket-rpcdump`, `impacket-smbserver`).
LHOST and the UNC path must both be your tun0 IP or the callback/SMB fetch fails.
STATUS_PIPE_CLOSING / Stage0: 0 is normal — re-run and watch the listener.
Raw reverse shell double-echoes keystrokes (cosmetic).
Mitigations
Patch CVE-2021-34527; set RestrictDriverInstallationToAdministrators = 1.
Disable the Spooler where unneeded (esp. DCs): Stop-Service Spooler; Set-Service Spooler -StartupType Disabled.
Alert on spoolsv.exe loading DLLs from the spool drivers dir (Sysmon 7/11).
